    "title": "Beñat Zapirain - ACL Anthology",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "![ACL Logo](https://aclanthology.org/images/acl-logo.svg) ACL Anthology ⟨1⟩\n  * About⟨2⟩\n    * Announcements⟨3⟩\n    * Communication channels⟨4⟩\n    * Related work⟨5⟩\n    * Copyright⟨6⟩\n    * * * *\n    * Credits⟨7⟩\n    * Volunteer⟨8⟩\n    * Development⟨9⟩\n    * Feedback⟨10⟩\n  * Using⟨2⟩\n    * Citing papers⟨11⟩\n    * Links in the Anthology⟨12⟩\n    * Data access⟨13⟩\n    * * * *\n    * All FAQs⟨14⟩\n    * * * *\n    * ###### Details\n    * Anthology identifiers⟨15⟩\n    * Names⟨16⟩\n    * ORCID iDs⟨17⟩\n    * DOIs⟨18⟩\n    * Verified authors⟨19⟩\n  * Contributions⟨2⟩\n    * Submissions⟨20⟩\n    * Corrections⟨21⟩\n    * Author pages⟨22⟩\n    * Attachments⟨23⟩\n  * GitHub⟨24⟩\n\n\n##  Beñat Zapirain ⟨22⟩\n* * *\n#### 2015\npdf ⟨25⟩bib ⟨26⟩\n**IXAG roupEHUSpaceEval: (X-Space) A WordNet-based approach towards the Automatic Recognition of Spatial Information following the ISO-Space Annotation Scheme⟨27⟩**  \nHaritz Salaberri⟨28⟩ | Olatz Arregi⟨29⟩ | Beñat Zapirain⟨30⟩  \nProceedings of the 9th International Workshop on Semantic Evaluation (SemEval 2015)⟨31⟩\npdf ⟨32⟩bib ⟨33⟩\n**IXAG roupEHUDiac: A Multiple Approach System towards the Diachronic Evaluation of Texts⟨34⟩**  \nHaritz Salaberri⟨28⟩ | Iker Salaberri⟨35⟩ | Olatz Arregi⟨29⟩ | Beñat Zapirain⟨30⟩  \nProceedings of the 9th International Workshop on Semantic Evaluation (SemEval 2015)⟨31⟩\npdf ⟨36⟩bib ⟨37⟩\n**b Rol: The Parser of Syntactic and Semantic Dependencies for Basque⟨38⟩**  \nHaritz Salaberri⟨28⟩ | Olatz Arregi⟨29⟩ | Beñat Zapirain⟨30⟩  \nProceedings of the International Conference Recent Advances in Natural Language Processing⟨39⟩\n#### 2014\n ⟨40⟩bib ⟨41⟩abs⟨42⟩\n**First approach toward Semantic Role Labeling for Basque⟨43⟩**  \nHaritz Salaberri⟨28⟩ | Olatz Arregi⟨29⟩ | Beñat Zapirain⟨30⟩  \nProceedings of the Ninth International Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation (LREC'14)⟨44⟩\nIn this paper, we present the first Semantic Role Labeling system developed for Basque. The system is implemented using machine learning techniques and trained with the Reference Corpus for the Processing of Basque (EPEC). In our experiments the classifier that offers the best results is based on Support Vector Machines. Our system achieves 84.30 F1 score in identifying the PropBank semantic role for a given constituent and 82.90 F1 score in identifying the VerbNet role. Our study establishes a baseline for Basque SRL. Although there are no directly comparable systems for English we can state that the results we have achieved are quite good. In addition, we have performed a Leave-One-Out feature selection procedure in order to establish which features are the worthiest regarding argument classification. This will help smooth the way for future stages of Basque SRL and will help draw some of the guidelines of our research.\n#### 2013\npdf ⟨45⟩bib ⟨46⟩\n**Selectional Preferences for Semantic Role Classification⟨47⟩**  \nBeñat Zapirain⟨30⟩ | Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ | Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩ | Mihai Surdeanu⟨50⟩  \nComputational Linguistics, Volume 39, Issue 3 - September 2013⟨51⟩\n#### 2010\npdf ⟨52⟩bib ⟨53⟩\n**Improving Semantic Role Classification with Selectional Preferences⟨54⟩**  \nBeñat Zapirain⟨30⟩ | Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ | Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩ | Mihai Surdeanu⟨50⟩  \nHuman Language Technologies: The 2010 Annual Conference of the North American Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics⟨55⟩\n#### 2009\npdf ⟨56⟩bib ⟨57⟩\n**Generalizing over Lexical Features: Selectional Preferences for Semantic Role Classification⟨58⟩**  \nBeñat Zapirain⟨30⟩ | Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ | Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩  \nProceedings of the ACL-IJCNLP 2009 Conference Short Papers⟨59⟩\n#### 2008\npdf ⟨60⟩bib ⟨61⟩\n**Robustness and Generalization of Role Sets: PropBank vs. VerbNet⟨62⟩**  \nBeñat Zapirain⟨30⟩ | Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ | Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩  \nProceedings of ACL-08: HLT⟨63⟩\n#### 2007\npdf ⟨64⟩bib ⟨65⟩\n**UBC -UPC: Sequential SRL Using Selectional Preferences. An approach with Maximum Entropy Markov Models⟨66⟩**  \nBeñat Zapirain⟨30⟩ | Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ | Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩  \nProceedings of the Fourth International Workshop on Semantic Evaluations (SemEval-2007)⟨67⟩\nSearch⟨68⟩\n##### Co-authors\n  * Eneko Agirre⟨48⟩ 5\n  * Lluís Màrquez⟨49⟩ 5\n  * Olatz Arregi⟨29⟩ 4\n  * Haritz Salaberri⟨28⟩ 4\n  * Mihai Surdeanu⟨50⟩ 2\nshow all...\n  * Iker Salaberri⟨35⟩ 1\n\n\n##### Venues\n  * SemEval⟨69⟩3\n  * ACL⟨70⟩2\n  * CL⟨71⟩1\n  * IJCNLP⟨72⟩1\n  * LREC⟨73⟩1\nshow all...\n  * NAACL⟨74⟩1\n  * RANLP⟨75⟩1\n\n\n Fix author⟨76⟩\n![Creative Commons License](https://i.creativecommons.org/l/by/4.0/88x31.png)⟨77⟩ ACL materials are Copyright © 1963–2026 ACL; other materials are copyrighted by their respective copyright holders. Materials prior to 2016 here are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 International License⟨78⟩. Permission is granted to make copies for the purposes of teaching and research. Materials published in or after 2016 are licensed on a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License⟨79⟩.\nThe ACL Anthology is managed and built by the ACL Anthology team⟨7⟩ of volunteers.\n_Site last built on 22 July 2026 at 14:46 UTC withcommit 280e4ed⟨80⟩._\n",
